[(During a performance you're unlikely to want to draw or)]
[(recalculate wavetables on the fly, because you don't want to)]
[(give Pd computationally intensive atomic tasks that could make)]
[(Pd miss a DAC deadline. Instead, use "set" messages to switch)]
[([tabosc4~] or [tabread4~] between pre-prepared tables.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
